          ],
          "createdAt": "2026-10-28T14:30:26.782233Z",
          "startedAt": "2020-05-30T19:54:47.8Z",
          "lastModifiedAt": "2026-10-28T14:30:26.782233Z",
          "description": "We've released Datadog agent 5.32.7 which fixes the certificate problem and restores connectivity to Datadog.\n\nTo upgrade from a previous version of agent 5, use the install command for your platform:\n\nCentos/Red Hat: sudo yum check-update && sudo yum install datadog-agent\nDebian/Ubuntu: sudo apt-get update && sudo apt-get install datadog-agent\nWindows: Download the Datadog Agent installer (https://s3.amazonaws.com/ddagent-windows-stable/ddagent-cli-latest.msi). start /wait msiexec /qn /i ddagent-cli-latest.msi\nMore platforms and configuration management options detailed at https://app.datadoghq.com/account/settings?agent_version=5#agent",
          "id": "a7dbe71d-6c86-5645-aa29-65a563f179b6",
          "status": "monitoring"
        },
        {
          "componentsAffected": [
            {
              "id": "e727cd93-80f6-4b7a-b8a1-54b784578288",
